cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "PetriNet.js"
abstract: >-
  A browser-based modeler for place/transition Petri nets with simulation,
  analysis of behaviour (boundedness, deadlocks, liveness, invariants, siphons
  and traps), state space view and PNML import and export. A fork of ptn-js by
  Maximilian König and the Business Process Technology group, built on
  diagram-js.
authors:
  - family-names: Nabizada
    given-names: Hamied
    affiliation: "Helmut Schmidt University / University of the Federal Armed Forces Hamburg"
version: 0.6.1
date-released: 2026-11-14
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/hsu-aut/PetriNet.js"
keywords:
  - Petri net
  - place/transition net
  - PNML
  - modeler
  - simulation
  - state space analysis
references:
